{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0133_1000_p", "source_sha256": "611e229d611bf6b955ded28ffda9270139ed80f00d0a52bb2bbfe3c6d60751c0", "ja": "（ひなた達のランニングライブが、ファンの人達\n以外にも話題になっている。今が売り込み時だな！）", "zh": "（日向她们的Running演唱会，在非粉丝的一般人之中\n也掀起了话题，现在正是推销的时机！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0133_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "a3fa6fc224f57238d11878a2c3c842220ec2acb90aff56d8aa2a52badba6c77b", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。\n今帰ってきたのかい？　お疲れさんです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，\n你刚回来吗？辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0133_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e87a811e436e6950e11f8f6bf93d1b39b3e2184ba71ebf3b7624a5f712e1bffe", "ja": "ああ、お疲れさま、ひなた。ちょうど、ひなた達の\n『キャンサー』の営業に行ってきたところなんだ。", "zh": "嗯，辛苦了，日向。\n我正好帮日向你们的『巨蟹座』跑了一趟业务。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0133_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "b458bf18b033bd4375614dafa67e028b15ceecc719a0a1c07c23439d40220929", "ja": "ありゃあ、そうだったのかい？\nいつもありがとねぇ。", "zh": "哎呀，原来是这样吗？\n谢谢你总是这么费心哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0133_1004_p", "source_sha256": "08382d055a01f9eacff703a0bbc656e4a2d79bad6e6e23449f4cdecf37c57680", "ja": "プロデューサーだからな！\nところでひなたは、外で何してたんだ？", "zh": "毕竟我是制作人嘛！\n对了日向，你在外面做什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0133_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "517579c904a2dc18990e9307b2b6a3288d1b9b2b7c5335b3672f817b3d47377f", "ja": "あたしは、美咲さんのお手伝いだべさ。\n洗濯ものが、たまってたもんでね。", "zh": "我在帮忙美咲哪。\n要洗的衣服积了很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0133_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "9298c3e76fa42cc41086bd30dfe0ef27aef506c617f802167cb93cfea6abaa2f", "ja": "{$P$}も、\n何か洗濯するものがあったら出してねぇ。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n如果你有要洗的衣服也拿出来吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0133_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2a63bd3aeea4b506943731c6788dc3f6f7ceefa181554f79c1ea158b967bb57f", "ja": "いや、俺は大丈夫だけど……\n手伝いありがとうな、ひなた。", "zh": "没关系，我不用……\n日向，谢谢你帮忙洗衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0133_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "2ddd53e4d7d0cbe94f9603f70cf74d4949b20c3fb676aeaeafe1c8f6b0c89496", "ja": "ううん、ついでだからねぇ。\nほら、この前、ランニングライブしたっしょや？", "zh": "不会，举手之劳而已哪。\n我们之前不是办了Running演唱会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0133_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "62039a3947f0752fb70a9802e5257430618014da20cc1a322a2899429453654f", "ja": "あれからもキャンサーのみんなと、走っててねぇ。\nウェアを、ここで洗濯させてもらってるんだべさ。", "zh": "在那之后，我还是有跟『巨蟹座』的大家一起去跑步。\n然后运动服就放在这边洗哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0133_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "dec87d076d6027bcd011eeb930fc07ff2baf82cc391ee5fc46e6235f334c4407", "ja": "レッスンとは別だから、みんなで洗濯しようって……\nそれで、今日はあたしが当番なんだわ。", "zh": "因为这不是在训练课程穿的，所以大家就想说自己洗……\n然后，今天是轮到我洗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0133_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8256867a8d30c9a2566a63fcf1fb40f994d921f2169cb1c37404173458d1ff83", "ja": "そうだったのか……。\nうん、えらいぞ！　みんなも、ひなたも。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……\n嗯，日向跟大家都很了不起喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0133_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "5e77ccf7d6d18b8e6f2ca2ffda4a18b92dd73e24fd47771042b79739b8d0bdef", "ja": "えへへ……あっ、そうだ。\n{$P$}、汗かいてないかい？", "zh": "嘿嘿……啊，对了。\n{$P$}，你是不是出汗了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0133_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "ad3c3ca1ae1df3d5eda40c9c718e7855e0c2f7c19528f70b98a7ecd98c4e4ca2", "ja": "小鳥さんが作ってくれた麦茶があるから、\nお茶にするべさ。あたし、いれてくるよぉ。", "zh": "有小鸟姊泡的麦茶，我们来喝茶哪。\n我去倒茶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0133_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "f14b18e2524f4269c799d1712dd54b57d7c9623eb8e4200cfe2dc595ad3d8735", "ja": "お茶うけに、家から持ってきた梅干しもあるべさ。\nひと息いれてねぇ。", "zh": "还有我从家里带来的酸梅可以当茶点哪，\n稍微休息一下吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0133_1015_p", "source_sha256": "75970988c49ba501dd4cb220df15585f37f731efd995b29d2fd2f004a0bdd0fb", "ja": "お、ありがとう！　音無さんの麦茶は美味しいし、\nひなたの梅干しは元気が出るからな。いただくよ。", "zh": "哦，谢谢！音无小姐泡的麦茶很好喝，\n日向的酸梅也能让人恢复活力呢，我就不客气了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0133_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "8c80f06139b4e6e8ad618a418eb49fdac0df4571aa843a4ed18e5824d5f82cf3", "ja": "本当かい？　したっけ、すぐに用意するよぉ。", "zh": "真的吗？那我这就去准备哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0133_1017_p", "source_sha256": "62e0fd8cf6408fcf5b8c0e3449148dfd62beb4616daed5978bd5b3f2f04d7ac7", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう。\nまだまだ暑い日が続きそうだし、助かるよ。", "zh": "嗯，谢谢你。\n炎热的天气应该还会持续很久，真是得救了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0133_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "7c334fc50be3988c78231b86bed61f9fda0827e30ccc250230536213d6caea32", "ja": "そうだねぇ……。\n夏はまだまだ、始まったばっかしだもんねぇ。", "zh": "就是啊……\n毕竟夏天才刚开始嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
